  "gloss": "protection; defense; guarding",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "protection; defense; guarding against harm",
      "explanation": "The act of protecting or shielding something or someone from danger, damage, or attack. Often used in technical, military, or safety contexts."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "23019_bougo_ex1",
      "japanese": "{防護|ぼうご}メガネを{着用|ちゃくよう}する。",
      "english": "To wear protective goggles.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "23019_bougo_ex2",
      "japanese": "{放射線|ほうしゃせん}からの{防護|ぼうご}が{必要|ひつよう}だ。",
      "english": "Protection from radiation is necessary.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "23019_bougo_ex3",
      "japanese": "{作業員|さぎょういん}は{防護|ぼうご}スーツを{着|き}て{現場|げんば}に{入|はい}った。",
      "english": "The workers put on protective suits and entered the site.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Emphasizes shielding or guarding against specific threats — radiation, chemicals, impact, etc. More technical and concrete than {防御|ぼうぎょ}, which focuses on actively defending against an attack.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {防護|ぼうご}スーツ: protective suit\n- {防護|ぼうご}マスク: protective mask\n- {防護|ぼうご}メガネ: protective goggles\n- {防護|ぼうご}{服|ふく}: protective clothing\n- {防護|ぼうご}{柵|さく}: protective fence/barrier\n- {放射線|ほうしゃせん}{防護|ぼうご}: radiation protection\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {防御|ぼうぎょ}: defense — emphasizes actively repelling an attack, common in military and sports contexts\n- {保護|ほご}: protection — broader term for safeguarding people, rights, or the environment\n- {防衛|ぼうえい}: defense — used for national defense or self-defense on a large scale",
